Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:58:36 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1395/1399] HERESY 1438: the Creator's long lists in the
 studio's own dialog
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 14.10.2026: «Селекторы ПИСАТЕЛЬ и ПРОФИЛЬ у Творца — попап оверлеями, как выбор пространства. Максимум, где есть массивные селекторы, переводим их в модальные попап оверлеи». A document from the Writer, a profile, a saved style and a text profile are chosen in the studio's dialog, as the workspace is (a filter on a long list, the one in hand marked). The select stays, hidden, as the state its code reads and writes; a value set by code shows on the button too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
